{"wl":{"T":"T3","K":"K1","A":"A4","C":"C1","R":"R2","D":"D2","S":"S1","P":"P2","E":"E3","L":"L4","G":"G1"},"knots":[[2026.6,2.6],[2033.25,3.0],[2034.0,4.0],[2038.0,5.0],[2042.5,6.0],[2100,6.0]],"crossings":{"3":2033.25,"4":2034.0,"5":2038.0,"6":2042.5},"events":[{"id":"bubble-correction","year":2027.7,"layer":"economy","text":"The AI capex complex corrects sharply; valuations reset while physical build-out survives.","cites":["analysis/ai-bubble-vs-buildout","concepts/ai-bubble-debate"]},{"id":"copyright-settles","year":2029.1,"layer":"law","text":"The copyright question reaches doctrine: appellate rulings settle training-data liability into a licensing regime.","cites":["analysis/ai-copyright-litigation","litigation/nyt-v-openai"]},{"id":"preemption-fight","year":2029.7,"layer":"law","text":"The federal-preemption fight over the state AI-law patchwork comes to a head in Congress and the courts.","cites":["analysis/eu-vs-us-ai-regulation"]},{"id":"parity-reached","year":2031.1,"layer":"geopolitics","text":"The second principal's frontier systems match the first's; the lead the hardware controls bought is spent and the controls stop binding capability.","cites":["sources/anthropic-2028-ai-leadership","concepts/export-controls-ai","sources/clover-new-arms-race-computing-power"]},{"id":"sc-crossing","year":2033.2,"layer":"capability","text":"Frontier systems cross the superhuman-coder line; AI-run engineering teams become the norm at leading labs.","cites":["sources/ai-2027","concepts/agi-timelines"]},{"id":"sar-crossing","year":2034.0,"layer":"capability","text":"AI research itself is automated end to end; progress decouples from human cognitive labor.","cites":["sources/ai-2027","sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]},{"id":"second-correction","year":2038.4,"layer":"economy","text":"A second AI capital cycle breaks a decade or more after the first; data-centre builders and their lenders reprice, as railway companies did in each mania after 1845.","cites":["concepts/ai-bubble-debate","analysis/ai-bubble-vs-buildout","sources/atlantic-good-bubble-shroff"]},{"id":"labor-constitution","year":2040.6,"layer":"labor","text":"Work's social contract is renegotiated: wage insurance, flexicurity variants, and the first serious dividend schemes.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption","sources/europe-2031"]},{"id":"ai-drug-majority","year":2043.2,"layer":"science","text":"AI-designed molecules are a majority of the year's new drug approvals in 2043, on the trial clock, two decades after the first.","cites":["concepts/ai-for-science","sources/fda-genai-device-discussion-paper","sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]},{"id":"digital-minds","year":2046.3,"layer":"far","text":"Digital persons hold legal standing in several jurisdictions; population statistics grow a second column.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a","concepts/ai-welfare","concepts/model-welfare"]},{"id":"late-accord","year":2052.9,"layer":"far","text":"The principals sign a compute-limit accord with inspections decades after parity, as strategic arms limits followed nuclear parity in 1972.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a","sources/historical-analogues-ai-governance-vermeer","concepts/frontier-verification-architectures"]},{"id":"controls-sunset","year":2055.1,"layer":"far","text":"The principals fold the unilateral hardware controls of 2022 into a multilateral list, as COCOM gave way to Wassenaar in 1994 after 44 years.","cites":["concepts/export-controls-ai","sources/historical-analogues-ai-governance-vermeer"]},{"id":"working-time-statute","year":2056.1,"layer":"labor","text":"A G7 country legislates a statutory working week under 32 hours, the first cut since the 40-hour week of 1940.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption","analysis/labor-disruption-timelines"]},{"id":"orbital-gigawatt","year":2056.5,"layer":"economy","text":"Orbital data centres pass a gigawatt of installed compute; launch cost sets their pace where permission set the ground fleet's.","cites":["sources/wsj-data-centers